    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Faten Ab",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114326967070072589241/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsDGl8jPmwrRtxAiSiyxoN02aiRcDxykD-8i_d54bQt2WGsX7AmA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Truly amazing service from beginning to end. Customer service was super nice and responsive before I booked my appointment and even accommodated an earlier date. Pricing was very clear and transparent, as were the pre-appointment instructions by email, so we knew exactly what to expect. Titus and Jean-Marc were super courteous and professional when they arrived and worked quickly and answered questions. I was very surprised at the minimal messy dust after the job, which they cleaned up. All in all, I'd call them again.",
        "time": 1766179633,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Long Board",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115112612397970603781/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkG6ztNL9vwKKKlZdiMMQl7CBLQmpkPWHbgO1XEIB1V6w_1Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Had them come clean my air exchanger, ducts and mini-split heads. John and Titus were very professional, efficient, respectful and had the knowledge to answer my questions. They did a great job, and I recommend them without hesitation. Great service!",
        "time": 1768503203,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paul Kamel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104571264649097888328/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI93l6ytPm-kEaynury7-97PbUwwtChzbzzMkchkC8BTQZIjg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent experience with Duct Masters! The entire process was easy, clean, and very professional. No more vacuum tubes all over your house like the old days. Much more efficient process now with a main vacuum for the entire job. John and Titus were outstanding—friendly, efficient, and incredibly thorough. They took the time to explain everything and made sure the work was done right. My home already feels fresher. Highly recommend if you’re looking for quality service!",
        "time": 1764098470,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stefano Di Lollo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106924592308872133918/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQ5N6ywvFH2GLsH5mozByGT8FoKQANnnnHWRLRPLA7okCB61y-dQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve had my home’s ducts cleaned by other companies in the past, and the experiences were not great — plus, the constant follow-up calls were like spam. This time, I did my homework and chose Duct Masters. They may be a bit pricier than some, but the service is far more complete, and their excellent reviews gave me confidence.\n\nJohn and Titus serviced our home today and were exceptional. Professional, thorough, efficient, and happy to answer all our questions. We’re very impressed and extremely satisfied. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1761419949,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sherif Shousha",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108607613520739285520/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXjeUhELdjYv9u0Kg2GVHLoCMbvGHnZ4rLQBLufRb-gtlGb7p4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Outstanding work, very thorough! John and Titus are very courteous, organized, competent and have a lot of experience. They left the place very clean, everything in order, and did all the work agreed upon very professionally! Having tried 2 other companies before, I can say that this company is the gold standard of the industry! Definitely recommend!",
        "time": 1759939052,
        "translated": false
      }
